{"4512180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vivid Intrusion", "steam_appid": 4512180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vivid Intrusion is a fast paced FPS roguelike with an emphasis on movement. Each run takes ~20 minutes. No wasting time on looting and exploration, instead get right into the action! Soak in the crystalline essence of those who oppose you and grow stronger. Want more weapons? Want more <i>infusions</i>? Complete the challenges of the cube and you will be rewarded.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>ARE YOU WORTHY?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of weapons. Destroy waves of enemies and bosses. Can you survive through the various challenges thrown at you?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 </strong>boss fights. Replay the game to experience them all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10</strong> unique enemies. No wave will feel the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6</strong> arenas with distinct environmental effects to put you out of your comfort zone</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>MOVE OR DIE</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, jump, and slide around the arena using the extensive movement system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>THE FOG CONSUMES</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena is constricted by an ever-shrinking wall of fog. Kill, or be suffocated.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>PROVE YOUR WORTH</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim the essence of your slain foes and infuse the your run with unique modifiers. With <strong>40+ infusions</strong>, every run is different. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512180/extras/ebcd0e5c87c7de60d0ef3f1ee8835fab.avif?t=1786404573\" width=1560 height=617 /></span></p>", "about_t